{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1730.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"109c24d4cc04598e6b3d65d059173815c33bdd3c2e99ea815bb58778bced1f93","ja":"おいしかった～！\nぷるっぷるの天津飯、最高～！","zh":"太好吃了～！\n软嫩滑溜的天津饭，最棒了～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1730.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6936db76e4c5258dbae5eec9997a420f8351e84013abaceebd1ac12632f0a33f","ja":"餃子の焼き加減も絶妙で、\nとてもおいしかったでしゅ～♪","zh":"饺子煎得恰到好处，\n真的很好吃呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1730.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"633ce8f1b548fc8c174c9853d467511c7aebc308188cf6da70ae7e2fe709fba1","ja":"「アイドルに接客してもらえるなんて、感激～！」\n「でもアイドルとの両立、大変なんじゃない？」","zh":"“居然能让偶像为我服务，太感动了～！”\n“不过还要兼顾偶像工作，挺辛苦的吧？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1730.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6c9209e3076fc02bb4e5f532fd820521d99679fd2fff094c4eb799ba11d9d097","ja":"「『パワフル盛り』ボリュームヤバいけどおいし～！」\n「すごい！　これはたしかに味も量もパワフル……」","zh":"“‘能量满满特大份’的分量太惊人了，不过好好吃～！”\n“好厉害！这个确实无论是味道还是分量都能量满满……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1730.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"428a618ad077553a537056dcfc5c79f0a655ae4fe35c05b3a39886e452a562b3","ja":"お客さんも楽しんでるね♪　でも、みなちんのこととか\nお料理の話題くらいで、変わったことはないかな？","zh":"客人也很尽兴呢♪　不过，除了美奈子\n还有料理的话题之外，就没什么特别的事了吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1730.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"367b4d0b79d573c26240bcceb37953468e32b45d90323a15c950cca1f16861b9","ja":"美奈子さんの、ごヒイキ様方が増えたのでしょうか？","zh":"是美奈子的老主顾变多了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1730.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"318cec422c39cddab7620d63eb72625d7e0f8318bd81cb0bb478748abc77c048","ja":"あと、建設会社の人たちもリピーターになったとか？\nうーん……あ、杏仁豆腐も食べちゃお♪","zh":"还有，听说建设公司的人也成了回头客？\n嗯——……啊，杏仁豆腐也吃掉吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1730.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"1af139110744b9f6e364d59b7bdf52358721564949d0c7e3df9ef2e4b1806a4d","ja":"さらに数日後……","zh":"又过了几天……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1730.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"c7ef6ace097166526863cee09a80ba39a7b7b07945c13ae91c2f763a7991cdce","ja":"お疲れさま、美奈子ちゃん。\nあと、ごちそうさまでした♪","zh":"辛苦了，美奈子。\n还有，谢谢款待♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1730.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"adf01706cd86144887b1ee334dc35b39e3031430953b5202d50b7bfd12e162de","ja":"たくさん食べてくれてありがとう！","zh":"谢谢你吃得这么香！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1730.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"416e936f1c9062f1a84b5328737180f815f06e2f5c28c2da232ab104456e3bdf","ja":"いえ！　美奈子ちゃんのご家族が腕を振るった\nおいしいお料理が食べられるだけで、幸せですので！","zh":"不用啦！只要能吃到美奈子家里人亲手做的\n美味饭菜，我就觉得很幸福了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1730.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"b25f333019ec30db88298b1e3fea1c30e20af4d211e779d087eddcefbe442384","ja":"けど、美奈子ちゃんのファンの人が多い気がする、\nってくらいしか、わからなかったな。","zh":"不过，我也只能感觉出\n美奈子的粉丝好像挺多的就是了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1730.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"797efa80b844dc196b85b8d249247f8371cb6fccf0c9e5d146154dee90508452","ja":"ファンの人が来てくれるのは、すごく嬉しいけど、\nでも今は、やっぱりそれだけじゃない感じだよね？","zh":"有粉丝专程赶来，固然非常开心，\n但总觉得现在果然还不止如此吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1730.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"f9ba24e313e80b5d01525b7960468d5ca251bc8135b3794d80683507191ed349","ja":"はい。ここはやはり、\nいろんなワードで検索を……ああっ！？","zh":"好的。这里果然还是要\n用各种关键词来搜索……啊啊！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
